<title>SWEDEN: Perstorp 6-mo results by business area.</title>
<headline>Perstorp 6-mo results by business area.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a breakdown of Swedish chemical group Perstorp's results by business area for the six months ending February 28, 1997.</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT (MLN SKR)	   1996/97	    1995/96</p>
<p> Chemicals				    218		  269</p>
<p> Surfaces					83		   83</p>
<p> Plastic Systems			    -18		   50</p>
<p> Pernovo					  8		   27</p>
<p> Others					 -29		  -56</p>
<p> TURNOVER (MLN SKR)		  1996/97	    1995/96</p>
<p> Chemicals			     1,973		 1,938</p>
<p> Surfaces				2,066		 1,918</p>
<p> Plastic Systems			 655		   669</p>
<p> Pernovo				   571		   582</p>
<p> Others				    407		 1,261</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom+46-8-700 1017</p>
